      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AT THE GATE (4) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (23.70) in a Grade 4/5 at The Gardens. Form here at this distance is sound. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. MAJESTIC EMMY (2) ran below best last time finishing fourth (17.68) over 300m at this track from Box 1. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Expected to feature in the finish. BLUE CHANELLE (7) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (23.04) at The Gardens. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from 10 starts. Will give a great sight again. LET'S TROT WILL (1) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
